# PipeliNostr v2 — Auto reply to greetings

id: auto-reply
name: Auto Reply
description: Replies to hello/bonjour messages
multiple: true

trigger:
  source: nostr.dm
  from_whitelist: true
  content_pattern: "^(?:hello|bonjour|salut|hi|hey)$"

actions:
  - id: reply
    type: nostr_dm
    to: "{{ trigger.sender }}"
    dm_format: "{{ trigger.dm_format }}"
    content: "Hello! I'm PipeliNostr, a Nostr event router. Send /help for available commands."
